title: Titles that stopped being true.
pid: e64c8bb4-3e62-41d1-8ea5-4f01aead9289
body: |2-
  The first message's title says committing the processed "is
  planned"; its first child says both halves are built. The note's
  body says it is sorted with what waits on Jeff first; the questions
  of 2026-11-13 19:15 and 2026-11-14 17:35 sit among build news, below
  answered messages.
